WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:36.820
In exchange for a plane ride home, we entered the KC Grand Prix.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:41.310
It’s exciting that duelists chosen from around the world are competing.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:47.240
But in the first match, Jonouchi's opponent was my Grandpa!

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:52.320
Grandpa was tough, but Jonouchi won the duel.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.330
I wonder who's up next?

00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:01.600
Fierce Fight!
Rebecca vs Vivian

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.540
Jonouchi, most people would notice such an obvious disguise.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.180
Say what!

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.850
B Block's second match is about to begin!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.440
B Block's second match:

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:23.720
The genius who became the youngest American champion ever, Rebecca Hopkins!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.170
Rebecca!

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:33.330
Her opponent is the beautiful duelist who ran through the Asia duel tournament, Vivian Wong!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.440
It's her!

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.840
She’s cute!

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.410
C'mon, everyone!  Let’s go cheer for her!

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.670
When you say "cheer for her," which one?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:48.480
Do you mean the beauty instead of your best friend’s granddaughter?

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.500
O-Of course Rebecca!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.830
Now let's hurry-

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.060
Grandpa?

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.210
Ouch...

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.300
Are you okay, Grandpa?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.660
He pulled his back.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.080
Oh no!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.660
I’ll call the paramedics!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.650
Don't worry, Grandpa.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.980
Yugi, don’t worry about me.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:15.520
Everyone, go and cheer for Rebecca.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.050
But...

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.820
Yugi, I'll stay with Sugoroku.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.740
Do what he says.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.470
Professor Hopkins...

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:29.000
Your support will help her.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.500
He’s our target.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.430
Should we really do this?

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.780
We've come this far!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:46.450
Don’t you want to get revenge against Yugi?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.110
I know!  It's humiliating to keep losing to them!

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:51.880
It's time to settle the score!

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.400
Why do I have to be on the bottom?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.690
Stop complaining.  Keep walking!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:23.390
Sigh...  It's lame that a pipsqueak like you is my opponent.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:29.580
If you were Yugi or Kaiba, I could use my beautiful dueling to make them fall in love!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:34.760
We'd rule the world as the strongest duelist couple!

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:36.290
Isn’t that fabulous?

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:41.200
I'm already part of the strongest duelist couple!

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.880
You brat!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:48.670
No matter how hard you try, you can't match my beauty or intellect.

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:51.100
I’ll make you realize that.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:09.880
Here I go!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:20.680
Duel!

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.080
I'll go first.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.470
I draw!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:32.440
I summon Kung Fu Nyan Nyan in attack position.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.110
I end my turn.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.900
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.560
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.490
Graceful Charity!

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:47.100
I draw three cards from my deck and discard two from my hand.

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:53.100
I summon Fire Princess in attack position!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.120
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:02.210
There she is!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.110
Up here!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.780
Hey, Rebecca!

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.520
Darlin-

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.820
Yugi!  You came to cheer for me?

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.220
I’m so happy!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.220
Hey!  My darling's here for me-

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:21.960
Watch me defeat this pipsqueak beautifully!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.430
Yugi, you’re popular with the ladies.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.140
I’m jealous.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:29.780
I-I don’t care-

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.310
Stop messing around!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.980
Rebecca, do your best!

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.910
Don’t lose to her!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.340
Right!  Leave it to me!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:40.840
I feel like dueling for real now!

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:44.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:47.640
I activate Kung Fu Nyan Nyan’s effect!

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:53.290
If it didn't attack while in attack position, it gains 300 attack points!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.360
I summon Master Kyonshee in attack position!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:05.610
Kung Fu Nyan Nyan attacks Fire Princess!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.000
I don't think so!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.280
I flip over my trap card!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.250
The Continuous Trap, Gravity Bind!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:20.590
While it's on the field, Level 4 and higher monsters can't attack!

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:30.260
She used her own monster as bait to set a trap.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.920
I end my turn!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.840
Impressive, Rebecca!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.200
But as long as Gravity Bind is on the field...

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.370
...Becky can’t use her Level 4 and higher monsters.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.320
What?  That means...

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.400
But Rebecca knows that.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.600
She has a plan in mind.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.760
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:58.420
I activate Marie the Fallen One’s effect from my graveyard!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:07.550
As long as it's in my graveyard, I gain 200 life points during my Standby Phase.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.990
I activate Fire Princess’s effect!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:19.240
Every time I regain life points, it deals you 500 points of damage!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.340
I knew it.

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:29.850
Yeah.  Even if she can’t use high Level monsters, she can still deal damage.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:33.600
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.790
It’s your turn!

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.710
It’s too quiet.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:53.500
Whoever's capable of hacking into Kaiba Corporation's main computer wouldn't remain silent.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.480
Is my enemy one of the competitors?

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:02.400
Recheck the duelists' identities!  All of them!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.150
Yes sir!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.090
I'll capture you, you rat!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:13.500
How dare you embarrass me in front of Yugi!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.610
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:25.240
Like I thought, I'm the goddess of victory.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.980
I activate the spell card, Mystical Space Typhoon!

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:33.920
It destroys one spell or trap card.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.850
Of course, I'll destroy...

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:38.790
Gravity Bind!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.660
Oh no!  If her monsters are free, Rebecca’s in trouble!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.260
I activate my Continuous Trap!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:49.300
Imperial Order!

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:55.460
As long as it's on the field, all spell cards are negated!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.650
Another trap?

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.650
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Scapegoat!

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.390
Your Mystical Space Typhoon is negated.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.560
Why didn't Scapegoat vanish?

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:18.620
Umm, because the Quick-Play Spell activates first...  And then...

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:26.640
Rebecca knew that when multiple spell and trap cards activate simultaneously, the last effect resolves first.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.240
What do you mean?

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:32.820
Scapegoat activated last, so it works.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:38.300
The card that activated before it – Imperial Order – negates Mystical Space Typhoon.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.330
That’s why only Mystical Space Typhoon was destroyed.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.080
I see...

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.800
What he said!

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:48.200
Do you really understand?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.760
Okay then!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:57.320
Level 4 or higher monsters can't attack, and I can't use spell cards!

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:02.640
Fine!  I summon Gyaku-Gire Panda in attack position!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:09.810
I activate Gyaku-Gire Panda’s effect!

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:15.080
It gains 500 attack points for every monster on your field!

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.590
It instantly rose to 3300 attack points!

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:26.740
Gyaku-Gire Panda is Level 3, so it can attack.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.430
Go!  Attack Scapegoat!

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:44.640
When Gyaku-Gire Panda attacks a monster in defense position, it deals piercing damage!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.360
Rebecca!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.290
I knew she wouldn’t let her win easily.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.240
What do you mean, Otogi?

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:58.660
Kaiba chose her as one of his powerful duelists.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.490
I’ve heard rumors about her.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:08.780
She used beautiful tactics and attacks to crush her foes and win the Asia tournament.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:12.980
The passionate flower of the nine dragons, the duel queen Vivian Wong!

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.910
Asia’s duel queen?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.200
I end my turn!

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.630
None of your cheap tricks will work.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.640
Just give up and surrender...

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.570
...pipsqueak.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.240
It’s my turn!  I draw!

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.040
You don't know when to give up.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:50.250
I don’t pay Imperial Order’s maintenance cost, so it's destroyed!

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:57.390
Due to Marie the Fallen One’s effect from my graveyard, I gain 200 life points!

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:03.230
And due to Fire Princess’s effect, you take 500 points of damage!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.660
You’re so annoying with those pinpricks!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:10.910
I’m not done.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.980
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.840
Token Thanksgiving!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:24.300
It destroys all tokens on the field, and I gain 800 life points for each one!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:34.500
Due to Fire Princess’s effect, you take 500 points of damage again!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:42.370
I summon the Level 3 monster, Injection Fairy Lily in attack position!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:53.350
I pay 2000 life points to increase Lily's attack points by 3000!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.520
Injection Fairy Lily attacks!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.840
Time for your shot!

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.670
Nice!  She made a comeback!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:11.830
The numbers keep changing in this duel that I can’t keep up!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.760
I end my turn!

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:17.000
How dare you!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.010
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.210
The spell card, Luminous Clouds!

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:31.240
By tributing Master Kyonshee and Kung Fu Nyan Nyan, this spell Special Summons Dragon Lady!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:39.010
That monster is Level 7!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.530
Though she summoned it, it can't attack!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.260
Partner...

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.930
Can it be?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:53.870
Once per turn, instead of battling, it can destroy one of your spell or trap cards!

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:01.050
Then I activate the spell card, Mystic Eruption!

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:07.880
Since your spell or trap card was destroyed this turn, you take 1000 points of damage!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.160
Rebecca!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.330
This is bad!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.700
She instantly lost her lead!

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:17.440
I end my turn!

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:20.350
Well?  Have you learned how skilled I am?

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.660
You're a prodigy?  What a joke!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.740
You'll lose next turn.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:29.540
I’m the one worthy of being with Yugi!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.710
As if!

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:38.110
Anything else to say before you lose?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.080
You'll lose this turn.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.180
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:47.820
Due to Marie the Fallen One’s effect from my graveyard, I gain 200 life points.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:53.430
And Fire Princess’s effect deals you 500 points of damage!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.650
But you can’t destroy my Dragon Lady!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:02.740
I tribute Fire Princess and Injection Fairy Lily...

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:06.180
...to summon Guardian Angel Joan in attack position!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.700
Thanks for destroying Gravity Bind.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.850
Because Joan can now attack!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:23.790
B-But even if you destroy Dragon Lady, I’ll still have life points left!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.000
I already took that into account.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.740
The spell card, Silent Doom!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:34.670
It returns a monster from the graveyard in defense position!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.680
Resurrect, Fire Princess!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.770
No way!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:45.060
Guardian Angel Joan attacks Dragon Lady!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.020
Guardian Angel Joan’s effect activates!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:58.800
I regain life points equal to the destroyed monster’s attack points!

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:03.450
Then Fire Princess’s effect activates!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.040
You lose 500 life points.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.620
No way...

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:13.760
Rebecca won!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.350
Well done, Becky!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.350
Darling!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.870
I won!

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:25.810
My darling belongs to me.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.060
How frustrating!

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:33.230
They’re done too.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:42.070
- Paul McGregor won A Block's second match.  The third match is Sieg Lloyd vs Fortune Salim!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:38.650
- Jonouchi, you're facing the winner of the third match.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.420
- You should watch carefully.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.740
What a snob.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.810
This is unacceptable!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:53.740
I want to be on top and duel!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.450
You fool!  We can’t do that now!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:05.890
You guys!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:08.080
Ryuzaki and Haga?

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:10.340
What are they doing here?

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.640
We’ve been discovered!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.510
You klutz!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.820
What did you call me?

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.070
What did you do with the real Salim?

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:24.720
He had a stomach ache, so he asked us to fill in.  Right?

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:28.600
Y-Yeah!  That’s why we're here!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.880
That can't be true!

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.600
You can't duel unless you’re registered to compete!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:34.760
That’s not fair!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.220
I don’t mind.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:40.270
Winning by forfeit is not beautiful.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:43.260
I’ll take you on.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.700
But...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.340
I’m going to win anyway.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:51.140
The match is already forfeited.  So let’s have a side show.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.140
I'll take you both on simultaneously.

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.380
We’re a side show?

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:58.850
We finished 1st and 2nd in Japan!

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.040
You'll regret this!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:08.300
I’ll show you just a hint of my abilities, Kaiba.

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:18.890
Let’s do this!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:19.850
Yeah!

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.780
I'll go first!  I draw!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:31.460
I summon Pinch Hopper in attack position!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:35.880
Then the spell card, Eradicating Aerosol!

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.560
It destroys one Insect-Type monster!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.300
Pinch Hopper’s effect activates!

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:50.740
When it's sent to the graveyard, I Special Summon an Insect-Type monster from my hand.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:54.460
Come, Insect Queen!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.280
How’s that?  It’s too late to get scared!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.940
I end my turn!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:07.920
I summon Balloon Lizard in attack position!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.250
Then the spell card, Ultra Evolution Pill!

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:17.480
By tributing a Reptile-Type monster...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.860
...I Special Summon a Dinosaur-Type monster from my hand!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.030
Come, Black Tyranno!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.160
How’s that!  I end my turn!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:36.020
Only Yugi and Jonouchi are our foes!

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.640
We’ll defeat a no-name like you!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.350
My turn.  I draw.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.310
What’s so funny?

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.250
He's giving up because he can't win!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:51.190
Actually, victory is in my hand.

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:55.130
I activate the spell card, Ride of the Valkyries.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:04.590
Appear, my Valkyrie maidens!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.600
Guide the warriors’ souls to Valhalla!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.490
What?

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:35.880
What happened?

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.300
No way!

00:21:58.470 --> 00:22:07.350
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:15.720
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.450 --> 00:22:26.880
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:36.370
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:45.430
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.210 --> 00:22:50.940
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:56.090
For me to be me

00:22:56.090 --> 00:23:04.580
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.260 --> 00:23:10.220
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:19.880
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:28.800
Jonouchi and Rebecca made the Top 8.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.530
Leon won too.  That's great!

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:36.250
But if they all make the Top 4, two will have to duel each other.

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:37.640
That complicates things.

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:41.020
But before that, they have to win their next duels!

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:42.680
Especially you, Jonouchi!

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:46.960
You're facing Sieg Lloyd, the one who defeated Haga and Ryuzaki instantly!

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:48.430
Be careful!

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:52.340
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Jonouchi vs Sieg
Beautiful Duel

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:53.890
Duel, standby!
